    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a node in the directed graph. All the connectivity information for the graph is captured in this (by way of the successor and predecessor sets).</para><para>This is a much simpler graph mechanism than that provided by util/graphs. It places most of the onus of edge bookkeeping on the nodes themselves. </para>    </detaileddescription>
